note Test driver: MODE CHECKPOINT. Prints exact logits and seeded draws across requests and shifts.
note Compiled independently with each path so scalar execution cannot repair the candidate cache.
fn main to int
mode = oargu 1
put oimode 0 mode
ockload 2
for job ulong 3
put oicount 0 0
put og 9 0
ocpush 0
for step ulong add get og 1 4
ocpush rem add mul step 17 job get og 0
if eq mode 0
loss = ofwd 0
olast
else
oifwd
end
iplog
draw = odraw add step mul job 1024 0.7
oputu draw
oputc 10
oflush
end
end
ret 0
end

fn iplog to void
for c ulong get og 0
oputh bitcast ulong get oa add get og 27 c
oputc 32
end
oputc 10
end
